*
!nvim/
!nvim/**
nvim/Session.vim
nvim/nvim.log
!hypr/
!hypr/**
!kitty/
!kitty/**
!rivalcfg/
!rivalcfg/**
!waybar/
!waybar/**
!dunst/
!dunst/**
!uwsm/
!uwsm/**
!fastfetch/
!fastfetch/**
# Desktop themes; the active one (theme-current) is a local symlink and stays out
!themes/
!themes/**
# GTK 3: only gtk.css (includes the theme's Thunar styling)
!gtk-3.0/
!gtk-3.0/gtk.css
# Own, possibly copyrighted files per theme (logo, images, music)
themes/*/private/
# Own scripts; symlinked into ~/.local/bin (see bin/README.md)
!bin/
!bin/**
# User services of the Hyprland session (units + drop-ins). *.wants/ are local
# activation symlinks and stay out.
!systemd/
!systemd/user/
!systemd/user/**
systemd/user/*.wants/
# Runtime state of the laptop monitor profile
hypr/.monitor-profile
# makepkg: AUR builds on all threads (this file only)
!pacman/
!pacman/makepkg.conf
# Bash config (~/.bashrc loads bash/bashrc)
!bash/
!bash/**
# Git: defaults and global ignore list (name/mail stay local in ~/.gitconfig)
!git/
!git/config
!git/ignore
# Check before every commit (bin/dotfiles-check)
!.githooks/
!.githooks/**
# Overview and screenshots for GitHub
!README.md
!docs/
!docs/**

!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
